msgstr "Every page begins empty. That is what makes it full of possibility."

msgid "The Guild Ledger remembers what hurried minds often forget."
msgstr "The Guild Ledger remembers what hurried minds often forget."

msgid "There is always room in the margin for one more story."
msgstr "There is always room in the margin for one more story."

msgid "A well-kept record is a kindness to those who come after us."
msgstr "A well-kept record is a kindness to those who come after us."

msgid "Every hero begins with a name, and every legend begins with a page."
msgstr "Every hero begins with a name, and every legend begins with a page."

msgid "A fresh name in the Register. Let us hope they remember to pack rope."
msgstr "A fresh name in the Register. Let us hope they remember to pack rope."

msgid "The Guild remembers its heroes, even when the heroes misplace their maps."
msgstr "The Guild remembers its heroes, even when the heroes misplace their maps."

msgid "A character is measured by their choices, not merely by their level."
msgstr "A character is measured by their choices, not merely by their level."

msgid "The finest adventures often begin with someone writing down a very bad idea."
msgstr "The finest adventures often begin with someone writing down a very bad idea."

msgid "Names have power. Titles mostly have paperwork."
msgstr "Names have power. Titles mostly have paperwork."
